WEBVTT

NOTE Recorded at the Larkspur pricing review.

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.500
<v Dana>Thanks for joining. I want to revisit the free tier decision from kickoff.</v>

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Sam>Right now the free tier includes 3 seats, and that is what billing enforces.</v>

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Priya>Clinics keep telling us three seats is not enough for a front desk plus two providers.</v>

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Dana>Then we change it. From October 1, the free tier goes to 5 seats. That replaces the kickoff decision.</v>

5
00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:09.000
Sam: I will update the seat limit in billing before October 1.

6
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Dana: And no annual discount for now. We revisit it in Q1.
